msgid "Credit"
msgstr "Crédit"

msgid "Debit"
msgstr "Débit"

msgid "Something is off with this payment, and only the provider's statement shows it. To catch it, become operator 1 and compare."
msgstr "Quelque chose cloche dans ce paiement, et seul le relevé du prestataire le montre. Pour le repérer, devenez l’opérateur 1 et comparez."

msgid "In the books"
msgstr "Dans les comptes"

msgid "Nothing until the provider says it was paid."
msgstr "Rien, tant que le prestataire n’a pas confirmé le paiement."

msgid "Nothing, as it failed."
msgstr "Rien, car il a échoué."

